# 16. Guided Full Keyboard Test

Provide:

**Começar teste completo**

The system guides the user through individual keys.

Example:

```text
1 / 104

Pressione:
ESC
```

After detection:

```text
✓ Detectada

2 / 104

Pressione:
F1
```

The system continues until all relevant keys have been tested.

