# 66. Final Product Definition

**TesteTecladoOnline.com is a multi-page Brazilian keyboard diagnostic platform powered by one reusable keyboard engine.**

The homepage focuses on the primary keyboard test.

Dedicated pages target specific user needs and search intents.

The product will initially be developed in English, fully tested, then localized into Brazilian Portuguese.

The Brazil version will prioritize:

**Portuguese language + ABNT2 + Brazilian search terminology + strong technical SEO + excellent UX.**

The website will not depend on hundreds of keyword pages.

Instead:

> **Build an excellent tool → publish useful pages → collect real search data → understand what users need → build the next useful tool.**

That principle governs the entire product roadmap.
